{
"file": 12,
"paths": [
"d002/f603"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "05f87fbc",
"en_raw": "...The taste of people?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "d3d8bfb0",
"en_raw": "Soy sauce on pudding"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "d408f81b",
"en_raw": "tastes like sea urchin, I know that"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "302f52f6",
"en_raw": "That's apparently how she answered"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "23d70f47",
"en_raw": "So she's called"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "ef4bcf88",
"en_raw": "Soy Sauce Granny"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "ab23e444",
"en_raw": "Huh, so that's the underpass's"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "d0e30cfe",
"en_raw": "new monster"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "ad98630a",
"en_raw": "They say she sings weird songs"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a296e9d4",
"en_raw": "and carries a kitchen knife too..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "187ef6e6",
"en_raw": "Why isn't she arrested?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "154a0787",
"en_raw": "Maybe it's because she hasn't"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "b441fa2f",
"en_raw": "done anything wrong"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "19a39ce7",
"en_raw": "A knife big enough to butcher a person"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "26ddc2e1",
"en_raw": "would be a weapons law violation..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "5cad8419",
"en_raw": "Anyway, there are students"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "fca21180",
"en_raw": "who are scared, right?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "c8e81d3f",
"en_raw": "Someone should do something"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "056590af",
"en_raw": "Yeah, and Nishi said"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "101ab94b",
"en_raw": "he'd drive her out"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "25dce7e3",
"en_raw": "Wow! As expected of Takayuki Nishi"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "1977679c",
"en_raw": "Nao, you could learn from him a bit"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "8f0ef26e",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f041421c",
"en_raw": "Not 'yeah' - say 'yes'"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "651fcc33",
"en_raw": "Got it? Then"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "04e7201d",
"en_raw": "let's go peek at that underpass"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "22d8d89a",
"en_raw": "before Nishi drives"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "0fe14ace",
"en_raw": "Soy Sauce Granny out"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "b331ac99",
"en_raw": "...Even so"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "a504ac2c",
"en_raw": "that underpass again?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "abc35567",
"en_raw": "Since Melos won't"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "18991255",
"en_raw": "go in there,"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6506da15",
"en_raw": "it's effectively closed off"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b2044ca7",
"en_raw": "Hurry up and renovate it already"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "f52cd6fc",
"en_raw": "Some 'I'll drive her out'"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "8b5e4ebb",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi is all talk"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "dfc01b71",
"en_raw": "What do we do?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0f568f60",
"en_raw": "Obviously, we go"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "0ed53abe",
"en_raw": "I'll drive her out myself"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "305b4dcb",
"en_raw": "If she's a man-eating old woman"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "0d8ba90b",
"en_raw": "like the rumor says"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c1804a24",
"en_raw": "Hey, that huge kitchen knife"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "103a61b6",
"en_raw": "Yeah, I saw it too"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "e2272082",
"en_raw": "So, with that, I..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "c16a5149",
"en_raw": "almost got eaten,"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "eb8d8837",
"en_raw": "is that what you're saying?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "03e5debd",
"en_raw": "Well"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "701e3a6d",
"en_raw": "Calm down, Nao"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "586547cb",
"en_raw": "There's no such thing"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "efe67ff8",
"en_raw": "as a man-eating granny"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "e4f3512b",
"en_raw": "Think calmly, realistically"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "1e07ad4a",
"en_raw": "and logically"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "be1aa80c",
"en_raw": "But... a bit..."
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "172e5806",
"en_raw": "I'll pass on this place now"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "55d52abd",
"en_raw": "...That person, the black thing"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "39e7b2c9",
"en_raw": "on her back, I can't stand it"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "ccd6def2",
"en_raw": "I'll expose her true identity"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "d607f747",
"en_raw": "What's with Soy Sauce Granny?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "1814f735",
"en_raw": "That's cheating!"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b7f1023a",
"en_raw": "It was really creepy, wasn't it?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "a5eaf7dc",
"en_raw": "Let's stop going"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "6f89e6ef",
"en_raw": "...I disagree"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "9854bd86",
"en_raw": "I won't forgive that!"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "c18593e3",
"en_raw": "But how do we"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "ebcd53bf",
"en_raw": "drive her out?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "76a8683d",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, you see, can't stand"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "64273525",
"en_raw": "the black thing on that person's back"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "313bf3fc",
"en_raw": "Stop saying weird things"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "c2612e7c",
"en_raw": "and suggest a way to repel her, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "ae27ea85",
"en_raw": "Sango, that old lady"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "09853634",
"en_raw": "really is..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "569d83ce",
"en_raw": "Did she do anything to us?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "f59280b8",
"en_raw": "Our eyes just met"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "043bdde8",
"en_raw": "But I couldn't move..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "fd780347",
"en_raw": "Like being bound..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "472ee991",
"en_raw": "It's your imagination"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "536d7c1c",
"en_raw": "So we just leave it?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "48749c3c",
"en_raw": "Yeah, leave it"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "1c13aa3e",
"en_raw": "I don't want to remember"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "185610ed",
"en_raw": "that soy sauce smell"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "36320dcc",
"en_raw": "It makes me nauseous"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "65cf17e2",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, even Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "11bd8bd7",
"en_raw": "Kurumi feels weird"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "1741509f",
"en_raw": "It's okay, I promise"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "38c0b3ed",
"en_raw": "Sango and I"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "f109f474",
"en_raw": "won't go there anymore"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "6ec90532",
"en_raw": "Yeah, Kurumi doesn't want to go"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "30d5ac69",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "06f07da9",
"en_raw": "But what?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "07952de8",
"en_raw": "Did you lose something?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "d4d24fe7",
"en_raw": "Don't tell me that hag"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "dcdfe5e2",
"en_raw": "did something to you?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "812ac358",
"en_raw": "I can't tell if you stay silent"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "81813036",
"en_raw": "Sango"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "06f4a424",
"en_raw": "Yeah, it's fine now..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "62a6cfbf",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't want to go"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "295afef7",
"en_raw": "but not going is bad too"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "b49c63fa",
"en_raw": "?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "40b8a0b1",
"en_raw": "Shiina is definitely weird"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "fc696215",
"en_raw": "Something with that old lady..."
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "27ad0f8f",
"en_raw": "Nao, you're persistent"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "e6266a36",
"en_raw": "She says it's fine"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "1a5d879b",
"en_raw": "so it's fine"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "733438f9",
"en_raw": "...Even if something happened"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3e2d9470",
"en_raw": "that's"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "be739f04",
"en_raw": "something only Shiina knows"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "129e0586",
"en_raw": "Melos came for me"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "3c618d1e",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "85345ce3",
"en_raw": "he slipped his leash and"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "b071c656",
"en_raw": "dashed under the tracks"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "e3fcbb1e",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what on earth"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "9f2dc6db",
"en_raw": "did you do?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "52a7bf4a",
"en_raw": "Yeah, to get it back"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "e6fb2c74",
"en_raw": "I don't understand anything..."
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "8acee47c",
"en_raw": "But I got it back"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "9b1e174a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's treasure"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "a45701cc",
"en_raw": "I said I don't understand"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "103c57e9",
"en_raw": "Whatever, she's safe"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "3809005c",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about this again"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "ee3672d4",
"en_raw": "tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "0d7c28fe",
"en_raw": "Kurumi is fine now"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "be4cbadc",
"en_raw": "Did Melos really"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "b754a213",
"en_raw": "beat Soy Sauce Granny?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "a33f174c",
"en_raw": "No way!"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "6faac288",
"en_raw": "This dog has no such"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "24682917",
"en_raw": "guts"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "edb87d8b",
"en_raw": "It's true, I love Melos"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "ab9d21b7",
"en_raw": "But since then"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "648fb809",
"en_raw": "she's apparently gone"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "32fdf53a",
"en_raw": "that old lady..."
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "cba9a5be",
"en_raw": "Melos's silver bell"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "60823d81",
"en_raw": "...Huh? It's gone"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "aebeffbb",
"en_raw": "I just remembered"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "c31e4b34",
"en_raw": "I think I've seen"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "a68ab459",
"en_raw": "that old lady before"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "c48e0287",
"en_raw": "Last year or the year before"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "cd95609c",
"en_raw": "at Tachikawa Station"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "8e15a02e",
"en_raw": "in the next town, under the tracks..."
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "8d3cd9f4",
"en_raw": "Yes, that was definitely her"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "e682b63f",
"en_raw": "Where is she now?"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "5823a046",
"en_raw": "Maybe Melos injured"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "6f0d0048",
"en_raw": "her..."
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "e3518ef9",
"en_raw": "You're so serious"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "cee60c9f",
"en_raw": "You're overthinking it"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "2e2afecf",
"en_raw": "But it bugs me"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "6fa4a5c8",
"en_raw": "The police might know"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "e6c75b5e",
"en_raw": "something"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "953b5177",
"en_raw": "Let's ask them"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "79e8a908",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "85828994",
"en_raw": "Going to the police to find out"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "a6023a8a",
"en_raw": "about Soy Sauce Granny is fine, but"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "3cc88a8e",
"en_raw": "if they say the dog bite was the cause"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "9fb220dc",
"en_raw": "and she died"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "103cb5e3",
"en_raw": "Sango?"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "669463fc",
"en_raw": "I don't know..."
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "da618d45",
"en_raw": "Let's keep quiet about Melos, okay"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "4bb3ee72",
"en_raw": "It was Soy Sauce Granny, right?"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "df1c9c25",
"en_raw": "Who went under the tracks"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "38776482",
"en_raw": "But I may have seen wrong..."
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "103b1b8f",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's go!"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "65d1630c",
"en_raw": "What if we hear that song?"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "92e39fe7",
"en_raw": "Soy Sauce is gone..."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "18489691",
"en_raw": "But Sango, you saw her before"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "f1bb19d2",
"en_raw": "at Tachikawa Station, right?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "ad8a3899",
"en_raw": "I might just have thought so"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "7d0ac507",
"en_raw": "Tachikawa is the next city, right?"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "9b09cd7b",
"en_raw": "Why did she come to Hirumi?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "9c515849",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "dbb6f288",
"en_raw": "Where did she go?"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "32346ae3",
"en_raw": "Hachioji, maybe?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "c44c240d",
"en_raw": "One night, one night, the taste of man"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "6504db5e",
"en_raw": "Soy Sauce Granny, huh..."
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "44fa11bc",
"en_raw": "What did she put soy sauce on"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "2c6d5bbc",
"en_raw": "to make it taste like people?"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "625633a5",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "00e89d25",
"en_raw": "She's gone from this town now"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "960874e4",
"en_raw": "Knowing that is a bit of a relief"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "266dc60d",
"en_raw": "Thanks to Shiina and Melos"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "6e76a087",
"en_raw": "I guess..."
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "bc61b3f9",
"en_raw": "Yeah, and thanks to Kasuka-chan"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "442714b1",
"en_raw": "too"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "427445bf",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Soy Sauce Granny"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "c436698b",
"en_raw": "Still, the underpass is still"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "354992e2",
"en_raw": "a scary underpass"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "8a4787a3",
"en_raw": "That place's rumors"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "8a645205",
"en_raw": "when will they ever end..."
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}